<h2>Check if you're logged in</h2>
<p>To check if you're logged in, you can call this command which lists
information about your AWS user session, or an error if you're not
logged in:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="nv">$</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">aws</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">sts</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">get</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nb">caller</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">identity</span>
</code></pre></div>